{"unit_id":"xikan0__dsh-outerwilds-theme#readme-1","repo":"xikan0/dsh-outerwilds-theme","commit":"5a9b1feaeee4f2269646b7498eec26cdcb846e7d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outerwilds-theme README · dsh-outerwilds-theme：以《星际拓荒》（Outer Wilds）为灵感的 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）主题插件。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-outerwilds-theme"}
{"unit_id":"xikan0__dsh-outerwilds-theme#readme-2","repo":"xikan0/dsh-outerwilds-theme","commit":"5a9b1feaeee4f2269646b7498eec26cdcb846e7d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outerwilds-theme README · 特色：- 支持调整背景亮度、星星数量、面板透明度、字号和布局密度。\n- 提供轻微篝火动效，也可以切换为静止画面。\n- 可选的侧栏音频显示屏，随系统声音呈现波形。\n- 字体随插件提供，无需在线加载。\n\n支持 DSH Web 与 Windows Desktop。系统音频响应目前支持 Windows x64。","source":"extracted","section":"特色"}
{"unit_id":"xikan0__dsh-outerwilds-theme#readme-3","repo":"xikan0/dsh-outerwilds-theme","commit":"5a9b1feaeee4f2269646b7498eec26cdcb846e7d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outerwilds-theme README · Web：确保已经安装 DSH，并且终端可以运行 `dsh`：\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-outerwilds-theme\ndsh web\n```\n\n如果 Web 已在运行，安装后需要重启。","source":"extracted","section":"Web"}
{"unit_id":"xikan0__dsh-outerwilds-theme#readme-4","repo":"xikan0/dsh-outerwilds-theme","commit":"5a9b1feaeee4f2269646b7498eec26cdcb846e7d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outerwilds-theme README · Windows Desktop：完全退出 Desktop，包括托盘进程，然后使用桌面版随附的 `dsh` 命令安装：\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-outerwilds-theme\n```\n\n安装后重新打开 Desktop。桌面版命令的使用方式见 [DSH 官方说明](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/blob/master/apps/desktop/README.zh.md#bundled-command-runtime)。\n\n也可以从 [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/xikan0/dsh-outerwilds-theme/releases) 下载安装包，将安装命令中的包名替换为下载文件的完整路径。","source":"extracted","section":"Windows Desktop"}
{"unit_id":"xikan0__dsh-outerwilds-theme#readme-5","repo":"xikan0/dsh-outerwilds-theme","commit":"5a9b1feaeee4f2269646b7498eec26cdcb846e7d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outerwilds-theme README · 启用：主题背景默认关闭，启用后显示。外观和音频响应均可在主题设置页面调整。\n\n建议关闭其他完整主题、壁纸和自定义配色，以免相互覆盖。","source":"extracted","section":"启用"}
