{"unit_id":"xikan0__dsh-outerwilds-theme#readme-8","repo":"xikan0/dsh-outerwilds-theme","commit":"5a9b1feaeee4f2269646b7498eec26cdcb846e7d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-outerwilds-theme README · Windows Desktop：完全退出 Desktop，使用桌面版随附的命令：\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile desktop update dsh-outerwilds-theme --latest\n```\n\n完成后重新打开 Desktop。\n\n如果此前通过本地安装包安装，可以重新运行安装命令，将包名写为 `dsh-outerwilds-theme@latest`，切换到 npm 最新正式版。","source":"extracted","section":"Windows Desktop"}
